  "id": "thermal-stimulation",
  "term": "thermal stimulation",
  "definition": "Thermal stimulation is the activation of sensory nerves by temperature, such as heat, as distinct from mechanical or chemical stimulation. In this context, it refers to temperature-based stimulation of the intranasal trigeminal system to assess heat sensitivity.",
